{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kakyuusei: Elf Version","High school students Mizuho Yuuki and Miko Kamiyama are best friends. Miko likes fellow classmate Tohru Nagase. Mizuho is determined not to get in the way of their budding relationship. But underclassmate Ai Minamizato also likes Tohru. Tohru must decide which girl he likes the most. \n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["エルフ版下級生 あなただけを見つめて...",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-661","ids":{"shikimori":661,"mal":661,"anilist":661,"kodik":"serial-23277"},"kodikIds":["serial-23277"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-23277":"2020-03-01T12:46:15Z"},"title":"Какюсэй: Эльфийская версия","originalTitle":"Elf ban Kakyuusei: Anata Dake o Mitsumete...","alt":"Какюсэй: Эльфийская версия Kakyuusei: Elf Version エルフ版下級生 あなただけを見つめて...","description":"Старшеклассницы Мидзухо Юки и Мико Камияма — лучшие подруги. Мико нравится одноклассник Тору Нагасэ. Мидзухо решает не мешать их зарождающимся отношениям, но Ай Минамидзато тоже влюблена в Тору. Теперь парню придётся решить, кого из девушек он любит по-настоящему.","year":1998,"type":"OVA","genres":["Драма","Романтика","гарем","Школа"],"rating":6.3,"popularity":1401,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/661/2dfb70ce7e64491d866d100c9e42b617.jpeg","width":470,"height":670},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/85d990bceeda7270185b1da67bbc7e7b96a15ffa.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":2,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-23277","translationId":"869","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/600457/c54db19063e017436a2fa55a647dff7f/720p","season":2,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":